meta {
  name: Wind with forced provider
  type: http
  seq: 31
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/wind?lat=39.92&lon=9.65&provider=om
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  provider: om
}

docs {
  The provider param forces one source instead of walking the
  auto chain: auto | wu | wc | om.

  An unknown name returns 400; a known provider with no data returns 502.

  The URL already carries ?provider=om, so this params:query block is
  documentation rather than a second source of truth.
}